## Challenges Encountered

### DNS Configuration Dependency

During Domain Controller validation, DNS-related warnings appeared because Active Directory depends on proper DNS communication.

Observed issue:

```text
DNS Client Event 1014
```

Potential impacts:

* Domain authentication failures
* Domain join issues
* LDAP lookup failures
* Group Policy communication problems

The issue was documented separately in the DNS troubleshooting section.

